Epson S1D13522 command firmware
================================

commands.bin is the 1,298-byte `isis_commands` program published in Amazon's
Kindle 3 Linux kernel source release for firmware 3.4.3.  Its source is:

  repository: linux
  Paper Resources revision: 2.6.26-rt-lab126
  commit: ebce95f39edb0e66652352517398c2e918e39558
  path: drivers/video/eink/broadsheet/broadsheet.c
  symbol: isis_commands
  license: GPL-2.0

The binary is formed by writing the hexadecimal byte initializers in array
order.  Its expected SHA-256 is:

  391efed1746232ceeda3307cf39c4af4395afe6282ac872b0b6d5bced5f4072e

Keep the corresponding GPL kernel source available when redistributing this
firmware.
